.*
.* WRKPRB: the problem log. The system logs no problems yet, so the
.* list is empty. No golden: pub400 refuses the command.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=IDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBID CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=PRBS VARS='OPT PRBID PRBSTS PRBTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=PBKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Report prepared problems
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKPRB KEYL=PBKEYS HELP=WRKPRB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Problems
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PRBS.(No problems logged)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 2'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display details
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 6'.6=Print details
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8'.8=Work with problem
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem ID
:LISTCOL VAR=PRBSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=PRBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKPRB.Work with Problems - Help
:P.The problems the system has logged, with their status. This
release logs none, so the list is empty.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
